     5078   run main-road-taxs in this-procedure
     5079     ( input p-artic     ,
     5080       input p-prod-type ,
     5081       input p-prod-code ,
     5082       input-output cur-rt-base ,
     5083       input-output cur-rt-rubl )
     5084       no-error .
